@startuml state_machine_bit
title BIT State Machine (per LLR-1553-BIT-009)

[*] --> POWER_UP

POWER_UP --> PBIT

PBIT --> OPERATIONAL : pass
PBIT --> FAIL : fail

OPERATIONAL --> CBIT_RUNNING : each CBIT cycle
CBIT_RUNNING --> OPERATIONAL : cycle complete,\nno fault

OPERATIONAL --> IBIT_RUNNING : IBIT request
IBIT_RUNNING --> OPERATIONAL : IBIT complete,\nno fault

CBIT_RUNNING --> DEGRADED : non-fatal result
IBIT_RUNNING --> DEGRADED : non-fatal result

PBIT --> FAIL : fatal result
OPERATIONAL --> FAIL : fatal result
CBIT_RUNNING --> FAIL : fatal result
IBIT_RUNNING --> FAIL : fatal result
DEGRADED --> FAIL : fatal result

DEGRADED --> OPERATIONAL : subsequent complete\nCBIT cycle passes

note right of FAIL
  Every state except POWER_UP
  can transition to FAIL on a
  fatal result (LLR-1553-BIT-009).
end note

note left of DEGRADED
  DEGRADED only clears via a
  full passing CBIT cycle, not
  merely the absence of a new
  fault.
end note

@enduml